{"version":1,"slug":"Others__SSC_CGL_MOCKS_2025_SSC_SUPER_PRACTICE_40041","path":"Others/@SSC_CGL_MOCKS_2025_SSC SUPER PRACTICE_40041.html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"@SSC_CGL_MOCKS_2025_SSC SUPER PRACTICE_40041.html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What should be divided by (x<sup>2</sup> + 6x  -  5) so that the remainder is 5 and quotient is x<sup>3</sup> + 4x<sup>2</sup> + x + 15? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>(x<sup>2</sup> + 6x - 5) &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359;&#2347;&#2354; 5 &#2361;&#2379; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#2349;&#2366;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; x<sup>3</sup> + 4x<sup>2</sup> + x + 15 &#2361;&#2379;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">x<sup>5</sup> + 10x<sup>4</sup> + 20x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 85x  -  70</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x<sup>5</sup> + 10x<sup>4</sup> + 20x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 85x - 70</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">x<sup>5</sup> + 12x<sup>4</sup> + 20x<sup>3</sup> + 3x<sup>2</sup> + 75x  -  80</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x<sup>5</sup> + 12x<sup>4</sup> + 20x<sup>3</sup> + 3x<sup>2</sup> + 75x - 80</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">x<sup>5</sup> + 8x<sup>4</sup> + 10x<sup>3</sup>  -  7x<sup>2</sup> + 105x  -  70</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x<sup>5</sup> + 8x<sup>4</sup> + 10x<sup>3</sup> - 7x<sup>2</sup> + 105x - 70</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">x<sup>5</sup> - x<sup>4</sup> + 10x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 95x  -  75</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x<sup>5</sup> - x<sup>4</sup> + 10x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 95x - 75</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Dividend = divisor * quotient + remainder</p><p>= (x<sup>2</sup> + 6x  -  5)*(x<sup>3</sup> + 4x<sup>2</sup> + x + 15) + 5</p><p>= x<sup>5</sup> + 4x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>3</sup> + 15x<sup>2</sup> + 6x<sup>4</sup> + 24x<sup>3</sup> + 6x<sup>2</sup> + 90x  -  5x<sup>3</sup>  -  20x<sup>2</sup>  -  5x  -  75 + 5</p><p>= x<sup>5</sup> + 10x<sup>4</sup> + 20x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 85x  -  70</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Divide 5x<sup>5</sup>  -  21x<sup>4</sup> + 7x<sup>3</sup>  -  x<sup>2</sup>  -  120 by x  -  4 and obtain the quotient and remainder respectively.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>5x<sup>5</sup> - 21x<sup>4</sup> + 7x<sup>3</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> - 120 &#2325;&#2379; x - 4 &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; &#2349;&#2366;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2324;&#2352; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359;&#2347;&#2354; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">5x<sup>4</sup>  -  2x<sup>3</sup> + 3x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 64, 76</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5x<sup>4</sup> - 2x<sup>3</sup> + 3x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 64, 76</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>3</sup>  -  3x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 44, 66</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>3</sup> - 3x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 44, 66</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5x<sup>4</sup>  -  x<sup>3</sup> + 3x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 44, 56</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>3</sup> + 3x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 44, 56</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5x<sup>4</sup>  -  x<sup>3</sup>  -  3x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 55, 96</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>3</sup> - 3x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 55, 96</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p><img width=296 height=217 id=\"Picture 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26852/image001.png\"></p><p>So, Quotient = 5x<sup>4</sup>  -  x<sup>3</sup> + 3x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + 44</p><p>Remainder = 56</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the remainder when 7x<sup>5</sup> + 15x<sup>4</sup>  -  6x<sup>3</sup> + x + 20 is divided by x + 3.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>7x<sup>5</sup> + 15x<sup>4</sup> - 6x<sup>3</sup> + x + 20 &#2325;&#2379; x + 3 &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359;&#2347;&#2354; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">665</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">665</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">- 307</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">- 307</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">- 476</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">- 476</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">343</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">343</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>By remainder theorem:</p><p>x + 3 = 0</p><p>x = -3</p><p>By putting the value of x in 7x<sup>5</sup> + 15x<sup>4</sup>  -  6x<sup>3</sup> + x + 20, we can find the remainder.</p><p>7x<sup>5</sup> + 15x<sup>4</sup>  -  6x<sup>3</sup> + x + 20</p><p>= 7 * (-3)<sup>5</sup> + 15 * (-3)<sup>4</sup>  -  6 * (-3)<sup>3</sup> + (-3) + 20</p><p>= 81(-21 + 15) + 162  -  3 + 20</p><p>= - 486 + 179</p><p>= - 307</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>When we divide 9x<sup>3</sup>  -  17x<sup>2</sup> + 9x  -  2k by x - 2, then remainder is 12. Find the value of k.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2332;&#2348; &#2361;&#2350; 9x<sup>3</sup> - 17x<sup>2</sup> + 9x - 2k &#2325;&#2379; x - 2 &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359;&#2347;&#2354; 12 &#2348;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; k &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>By remainder theorem:</p><p>x  -  2 = 0</p><p>x = 2</p><p>By putting the value of x in 9x<sup>3</sup>  -  17x<sup>2</sup> + 9x  -  2k, the remainder will be 12.</p><p>9x<sup>3</sup>  -  17x<sup>2</sup> + 9x  -  2k = 12</p><p>9*2<sup>3</sup>  -  17*2<sup>2</sup> + 9*2  -  2k = 12</p><p>72  -  68 + 18  -  2k = 12</p><p>2k = 10</p><p>k = 5</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>When we divide 2x<sup>4</sup> + 5x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + k by x + 3, then remainder is  -  6. Find the value of k.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2332;&#2348; &#2361;&#2350; 2x<sup>4</sup> + 5x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + k &#2325;&#2379; x + 3 &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359;&#2347;&#2354; - 6 &#2348;&#2330;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; k &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-9</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>By remainder theorem:</p><p>x + 3 = 0</p><p>x = -3</p><p>By putting the value of x in 2x<sup>4</sup> + 5x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + k, the remainder will be -6.</p><p>2x<sup>4</sup> + 5x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 11x + k = -6</p><p>2*(-3)<sup>4</sup> + 5*(-3)<sup>3</sup> + (-3)<sup>2</sup> + 11*(-3) + k = -6</p><p>162  -  135 + 9  -  33 + k = -6</p><p>k = - 9</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>For what value of k will be following system of equations have infinite solution? </p><p>4x + 9y + 5 = 0, 8x + (5k  -  2)y + 10 = 0</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>k &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2306;&#2340; &#2361;&#2354; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p><p>4x + 9y + 5 = 0, 8x + (5k - 2)y + 10 = 0</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Rearranging the equation:</p><p>4x + 9y =  -  5</p><p>8x + (5k  -  2)y =  -  10</p><p>For infinite solutions:</p><p>a<sub>1</sub>/a<sub>2</sub> = b<sub>1</sub>/b<sub>2</sub> = c<sub>1</sub>/c<sub>2</sub> </p><p>4/8 = 9/(5k  -  2) = -5/-10</p><p>5k  -  2 = 18</p><p>k = 4</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>For what value of k will be following system of equations have no solution? </p><p>(k  -  1)x + 9y + 3 = 0, 14x  -  6y + 17 = 0</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>k &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2361;&#2354; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p><p>(k - 1)x + 9y + 3 = 0, 14x - 6y + 17 = 0</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">20</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">20</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-20</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-20</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-18</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Rearranging the equation:</p><p>(k  -  1)x + 9y =  - 3</p><p>14x  -  6y =  - 17</p><p>For no solution:</p><p>a<sub>1</sub>/a<sub>2</sub> = b<sub>1</sub>/b<sub>2</sub> &#8800; c<sub>1</sub>/c<sub>2</sub> </p><p>(k  -  1)/14 = 9/(-6) &#8800; -3/-17</p><p>(k  -  1)/14 = 9/(-6)</p><p>k  -  1 = - 21</p><p>k = -20</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The number of &#8377;10 coins is 3 times as many as the number of &#8377;5 coins, and the ratio of the number of &#8377;2 and &#8377;5 is 5:9 respectively. If the total number of coins lies between 300 and 350, then what is the total value of all the coins?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>'10 &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; '5 &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2375; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; '2 &#2324;&#2352; '5 &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 5:9 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2360;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; 300 &#2324;&#2352; 350 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2360;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;2400</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;2400</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;2720</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;2720</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;2600</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;2600</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;2840</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;2840</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Let the number of &#8377;5 coins = x</p><p>Number of &#8377;10 coins = 3x </p><p>Number of &#8377;2 coins =&gt; 5x/9</p><p>Total number of all the coins = x + 3x + 5x/9 = 41x/9</p><p>So, the total number of coins are multiple of 41.</p><p>Since, 300 &lt; 41*8 &lt; 350</p><p>So, total number of coins = 41*8</p><p>41x/9 = 41*8</p><p>x = 72</p><p>Total value of all the coins = 5*x + 10*3x + 2*5x/9</p><p>= (35 + 10/9)*72</p><p>= 8*325</p><p>= &#8377;2600</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Cost of drink A per litre is 3/5 of the cost of drink B per litre. A man wanted to buy certain quantity of drink A and 8 litres of drink B. But by mistake, the quantity of drink A and drink B got exchanged so the man is ended up paying 40% more. How much quantity of drink A did he wants to buy?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2346;&#2375;&#2351; A &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340;, &#2346;&#2375;&#2351; B &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; &#2325;&#2366; 3/5 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2346;&#2375;&#2351; A &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2375;&#2351; B &#2325;&#2375; 8 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2340;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404; &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2375;&#2351; A &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2375;&#2351; B &#2325;&#2368; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2327;&#2312;, &#2311;&#2360;&#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2379; 40% &#2309;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366; &#2346;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2404; &#2357;&#2361; &#2346;&#2375;&#2351; A &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2340;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">50 litres</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">50 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">35 litres</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">35 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">40 litres</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">40 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">30 litres</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">30 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Cost of drink B per litre = &#8377;5a</p><p>Cost of drink A per litre = &#8377;3a</p><p>Let the quantity of drink A bought by man = 'b' litres</p><p>Original cost = b*3a + 8*5a = a(3b + 40)</p><p>Cost after exchange = 8*3a + b*5a = a(24 + 5b)</p><p>Now,</p><p>a(24 + 5b) = 140% of a(3b + 40)</p><p>5(24 + 5b) = 7(3b + 40)</p><p>4b = 160</p><p>b = 40</p><p>So, the quantity of drink A he wants to buy = 40 litres</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The age of Atul, Vibha and Karan are in AP respectively. After two years, the age of Atul is one-third of the age of Karan and present age of Vibha is 3 years less than thrice of the present age of Atul. Find the sum of their current ages.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2309;&#2340;&#2369;&#2354;, &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2351;&#2369; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2342;&#2379; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2309;&#2340;&#2369;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2351;&#2369; &#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2351;&#2369; &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2340;&#2367;&#2361;&#2366;&#2312; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2310;&#2351;&#2369; &#2309;&#2340;&#2369;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2310;&#2351;&#2369; &#2325;&#2375; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; 3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2350; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2310;&#2351;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">30 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">30 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">24 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">24 &#2360;&#2366;&#2354;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">36 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">36 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">42 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">42 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Let the age of Atul, Vibha and Karan are (a  -  d), a and (a + d) respectively.</p><p>Now,</p><p>(a  -  d) + 2 = 1/3 * (a + d + 2)</p><p>a = 2d  -  2 -----(1)</p><p>and</p><p>a = 3 * (a  -  d)  -  3</p><p>2a = 3d + 3 -----(2)</p><p>From eqn (1) and (2)  -  </p><p>4d  -  4 = 3d + 3</p><p>d = 7, a = 12</p><p>Sum of their current ages = a  -  d + a + a + d = 3*12 = 36 years</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Gunjan buys &#8377;3840 worth of books for the students in a library. For each fiction book, she pays &#8377;150, and for each non-fiction book, she pays &#8377;120. How many fiction and non-fiction books did she buy?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2327;&#2369;&#2306;&#2332;&#2344; &#2319;&#2325; &#2354;&#2366;&#2311;&#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2352;&#2368; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2331;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; 3840 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2366;&#2348;&#2375;&#2306; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2347;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2366;&#2348; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2357;&#2361; 150 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2344;&#2377;&#2344;-&#2347;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2366;&#2348; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; 120 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2347;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2344;&#2377;&#2344;-&#2347;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2366;&#2348;&#2375;&#2306; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2368;&#2306;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">10, 19</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">10, 19</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">12, 17</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">12, 17</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">9, 22</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9, 22</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">14, 16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">14, 16</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Let the number of fiction and non-fiction books are A and B respectively.</p><p>Since, she pays &#8377;150 for fiction and &#8377;120 for non-fiction books, so  -  </p><p>150A + 120B = &#8377;3840</p><p>5A + 4B = 128</p><p>From option a: 5*10 + 4*19 = 126</p><p>From option b: 5*12 + 4*17 = 128</p><p>From option c: 5*9 + 4*22 = 133</p><p>From option d: 5*14 + 4*16 = 134</p><p>Hence, option b is correct.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>At a certain time in a park, the number of legs of parrots and frogs were counted and it was found that there were 43 heads and 136 legs. Find the difference between the number of parrots and frogs in the park. </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2340;&#2379;&#2340;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;&#2338;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2376;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2367;&#2344;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2367;&#2352; 43 &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2376;&#2352; 136 &#2341;&#2375;&#2404; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2340;&#2379;&#2340;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;&#2338;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Let the number of parrots (two legs) and frogs (four legs) in the park are X and Y respectively.</p><p>Total number of heads = 43</p><p>X + Y = 43 -----(1)</p><p>Total number of legs = 136</p><p>2X + 4Y = 136 -----(2)</p><p>From eqn (1) and (2)  -  </p><p>X = 18, Y = 25</p><p>Required difference = 25  -  18 = 7</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The cost of 4 bowls and 7 spoons is &#8377;280 and the cost of 5 bowls and 3 spoons is &#8377;235. What is the total cost (in &#8377;) of one bowl and one spoon together?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>4 &#2325;&#2335;&#2379;&#2352;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; 7 &#2330;&#2350;&#2381;&#2350;&#2330;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; &#8377;280 &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; 5 &#2325;&#2335;&#2379;&#2352;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; 3 &#2330;&#2350;&#2381;&#2350;&#2330;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; &#8377;235 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2335;&#2379;&#2352;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2330;&#2350;&#2381;&#2350;&#2330; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; (&#8377; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;55</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;55</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;36</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;36</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;72</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;72</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;48</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;48</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Let the cost of one bowl and one spoon is &#8377;X and &#8377;Y respectively.</p><p>According to the questions:</p><p>4X + 7Y = 280 --------(1)</p><p>5X + 3Y = 235 --------(2)</p><p>From eqn (1) and (2)  - </p><p>23Y = 460 =&gt; Y = 20</p><p>X = 35</p><p>Total cost of one bowl and one spoon = 35 + 20 = &#8377;55</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The cost of 4 pens is &#8377;72. The cost of 10 pens is equal to that of 15 pencils. The cost of 5 pencils is equal to that of 6 erasers. The cost of 20 erasers is equal to that of 25 sharpeners. What is the cost (in &#8377;) of 14 sharpeners?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>4 &#2346;&#2375;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; 72 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 10 &#2346;&#2375;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; 15 &#2346;&#2375;&#2306;&#2360;&#2367;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 5 &#2346;&#2375;&#2306;&#2360;&#2367;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; 6 &#2352;&#2348;&#2337;&#2364; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 20 &#2352;&#2348;&#2337;&#2364; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; 25 &#2358;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2346;&#2344;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 14 &#2358;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2346;&#2344;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; (&#8377; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;112</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;112</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;140</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;140</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;98</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;98</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;168</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;168</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Cost of 4 pens = &#8377;72</p><p>Cost of 15 pencils = Cost of 10 pens = 10*72/4 = &#8377;180</p><p>Cost of 6 erasers = cost of 5 pencils = 5*180/15 = 60</p><p>Cost of 25 sharpeners = cost of 20 erasers = 20*60/6 = 200</p><p>Cost of 14 sharpeners = 14*200/25 = &#8377;112</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the values of x, y and z, so as to satisfy the equations given below:</p><p>x + y + z = 18, x + y  -  z = 4, x  -  y + z = 8 </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>x, y &#2324;&#2352; z &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2340;&#2366;&#2325;&#2367; &#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2360;&#2306;&#2340;&#2369;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;&#2306;:</p><p>x + y + z = 18, x + y - z = 4, x - y + z = 8 </p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">x = 6, y = -5, z = 7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = 6, y = -5, z = 7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">x = 6, y = 5, z = 7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = 6, y = 5, z = 7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">x = -6, y = -5, z = 7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = -6, y = -5, z = 7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">x = 6, y = 5, z = -7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = 6, y = 5, z = -7</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>x + y + z = 18, x + y  -  z = 4, x  -  y + z = 8 </p><p>Only option 'b' satisfies the equation x + y + z = 18. i.e.</p><p>6 + 5 + 7 = 18</p><p>x + y  -  z = 4 =&gt; 6 + 5  -  7 = 4 </p><p>x  -  y + z = 6  -  5 + 7 = 8</p><p>Hence, option 'b' is correct.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the values of x, y and z, so as to satisfy the equations given below:</p><p>x + y + z = 13, x  -  y  -  z = -5, x + y  -  z = 9 </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>x, y &#2324;&#2352; z &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2340;&#2366;&#2325;&#2367; &#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2360;&#2306;&#2340;&#2369;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;&#2306;:</p><p>x + y + z = 13, x - y - z = -5, x + y - z = 9 </p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">x = 4, y = 7, z = -2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = 4, y = 7, z = -2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">x = -4, y = 7, z = 2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = -4, y = 7, z = 2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">x = 4, y = -7, z = 2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = 4, y = -7, z = 2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">x = 4, y = 7, z = 2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = 4, y = 7, z = 2</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>x + y + z = 13, x  -  y  -  z = -5, x + y  -  z = 9 </p><p>Only option 'd' satisfies the equation x + y + z = 13. i.e.</p><p>4 + 7 + 2 = 13</p><p>x  -  y  -  z = 4  -  7  -  2 = - 5 </p><p>x  -  y + z = 4 + 7  -  2 = 9</p><p>Hence, option 'd' is correct.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Rishabh bought few notebooks for &#8377;900 from a bookstore. He negotiated the price and the shopkeeper reduced it by &#8377;5 per notebook. Due to this Rishabh could buy two more notebooks than what he had bought earlier. How many notebooks did he originally buy?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2315;&#2359;&#2349; &#2344;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2366;&#2348; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#8377;900 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2344;&#2379;&#2335;&#2348;&#2369;&#2325; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2368;&#2306;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; &#2346;&#2352; &#2350;&#2379;&#2354;-&#2340;&#2379;&#2354; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2344;&#2379;&#2335;&#2348;&#2369;&#2325; &#8377;5 &#2325;&#2350; &#2325;&#2352; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360; &#2357;&#2332;&#2361; &#2360;&#2375; &#2315;&#2359;&#2349; &#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2344;&#2379;&#2335;&#2348;&#2369;&#2325; &#2360;&#2375; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2379;&#2335;&#2348;&#2369;&#2325; &#2332;&#2364;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2342;&#2366; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342; &#2354;&#2368;&#2306;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2344;&#2379;&#2335;&#2348;&#2369;&#2325; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2368;&#2306;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">14</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">14</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Let cost price of a notebook = &#8377;P</p><p>Number of notebooks = N</p><p>P * N = 900</p><p>After negotiation:</p><p>Cost price of a notebook = &#8377;(P  -  5)</p><p>Number of notebooks = N + 2</p><p>(P  -  5)(N + 2) = 900</p><p>(900/N  -  5)(N + 2) = 900</p><p>(180  -  N)(N + 2) = 180N</p><p>N<sup>2</sup> + 2N  -  360 = 0</p><p>N<sup>2</sup> + 20N  -  18N  -  360 = 0</p><p>(N  -  18) (N + 20) = 0</p><p>N = 18</p><p>Number of notebooks = 18</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In a school, there are 550 girls and 1100 boys in the first year. Each year, 50 new girls admitted and 60 boys left the school. When will the number of boys is equal to the number of girls after the first year?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2370;&#2354; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2354; 550 &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305; &#2324;&#2352; 1100 &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2325;&#2375; &#2341;&#2375;&#2404; &#2361;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2354; 50 &#2344;&#2312; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305; &#2342;&#2366;&#2326;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366; &#2354;&#2375;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; 60 &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2370;&#2354; &#2331;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2354;&#2337;&#2364;&#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2325;&#2348; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2368;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">4 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5 &#2360;&#2366;&#2354;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">6 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6 &#2360;&#2366;&#2354;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Let the number of girls and boys are equal after n years.</p><p>Number of girls after n year = 550 + 50n</p><p>Number of boys after n year = 1100  -  60n</p><p>Now,</p><p>550 + 50n = 1100  -  60n</p><p>110n = 550</p><p>n = 5 years</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The ratio of present ages of Arvind and Reena is 9 : 11. After 16 years, the ratio of their ages will be 12 : 13. What is Arvind&#8217;s present age (in years)?</p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2309;&#2352;&#2357;&#2367;&#2306;&#2342; &#2324;&#2352; &#2352;&#2368;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2310;&#2351;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; 9 : 11 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 16 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2351;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; 12 : 13 &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;&#2404; &#2309;&#2352;&#2357;&#2367;&#2306;&#2342; &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2310;&#2351;&#2369; (&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">72/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">72/5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">48/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">48/5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">60/7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">60/7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">36/7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">36/7</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>With reference to question,</p><p>Present age &#8211; Arvind : Reena</p><p>9 : 11</p><p>After 16 years -</p><p>According to question,</p><p><img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/243162f45b087b952ed0533f6e52c3a6.png\"/></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the values of a and b for which the following system of equations has infinite solutions.</p><p>(7  -  a)x + (3b  -  8)y = 5 and (7 + b)x + 7ay = 15</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>a &#2324;&#2352; b &#2325;&#2375; &#2357;&#2361; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2367;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2344;&#2306;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>(7 - a)x + (3b - 8)y = 5 &#2324;&#2352; (7 + b)x + 7ay = 15</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">a = 2 and b = 4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">a = 2 &#2324;&#2352; b = 4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">a = 3 and b = 4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">a = 3 &#2324;&#2352; b = 4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">a = 2 and b = 5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">a = 2 &#2324;&#2352; b = 5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">a = 3 and b = 5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">a = 3 &#2324;&#2352; b = 5</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>(7  -  a)x + (3b  -  8)y = 5 and (7 + b)x + 7ay = 15</p><p>For infinite solution  -  </p><p>a<sub>1</sub>/a<sub>2</sub> = b<sub>1</sub>/b<sub>2</sub> = c<sub>1</sub>/c<sub>2</sub></p><p>(7  -  a)/(7 + b) = 5/15 = 1/3</p><p>3a + b = 14 ----(1)</p><p>(3b  -  8)/7a = 5/15 = 1/3</p><p>9b  -  7a = 24 ----(2)</p><p>From (1) and (2)  -  </p><p>a = 3 and b = 5</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}